# infra/

- Supabase SSR/browser/admin/proxy: `infra/supabase/**` (shim: `src/utils/supabase/**`).
- Resend wiring: `infra/email/resend-api.ts`.
- Auth connectivity: `infra/auth/site-url-for-auth.ts`, `resolve-auth-user-by-email.ts`.
- No business rules or domain workflows here — those belong in `modules/`.
- Do not import from `modules/**`.
- Prefer `@infra/...` for intentional new imports.
